{"id":"m1-u01","level":"m1","order":1,"title":{"en":"Airport and travel","fr":"À l'aéroport et en voyage","es":"Aeropuerto y viajes","ar":"المطار والسفر"},"tip":{"en":"Use 'I would like...' to ask for things politely: 'I would like a window seat.' Announcements are short and formal, so listen for the flight number and the gate.","fr":"Utilisez « Je voudrais... » pour demander poliment : « Je voudrais une place côté fenêtre. » Les annonces sont courtes et formelles : écoutez bien le numéro du vol et la porte.","es":"Usa «Quisiera...» para pedir con educación: «Quisiera un asiento de ventanilla». Los avisos son breves y formales: fíjate en el número del vuelo y en la puerta.","ar":"استخدم «أود...» للطلب بأدب: «أود مقعدا بجانب النافذة». الإعلانات قصيرة ورسمية، فانتبه إلى رقم الرحلة والبوابة."},"words":39,"lessons":[{"id":"m1-u01-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"airport, flight, ticket","fr":"aéroport, vol, billet","es":"aeropuerto, vuelo, billete","ar":"مطار، رحلة جوية، تذكرة"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u01-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"luggage, suitcase, hand luggage","fr":"bagages, valise, bagage à main","es":"equipaje, maleta, equipaje de mano","ar":"أمتعة، حقيبة سفر، حقيبة يد"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u01-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"arrival, delay, passenger","fr":"arrivée, retard, passager","es":"llegada, retraso, pasajero","ar":"وصول، تأخير، راكب"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u01-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"check-in, seat, aisle","fr":"enregistrement, place, couloir","es":"facturación, asiento, pasillo","ar":"تسجيل الوصول، مقعد، ممر"},"count":10},{"id":"m1-u01-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"to board, to land, to take off","fr":"embarquer, atterrir, décoller","es":"embarcar, aterrizar, despegar","ar":"يصعد إلى الطائرة، يهبط، يقلع"},"count":11},{"id":"m1-u01-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"direct flight, stopover, one-way","fr":"vol direct, escale, aller simple","es":"vuelo directo, escala, solo 